                "text": "Cytion is a biotech company focused on scientific health care breakthroughs. They are moving into USD\u2019s Discovery District which will give companies like theirs access to students, especially those in medical school and biomedical engineering. This partnership will not just benefit Cytion, but the biotech industry for years to come.",
